/*
  DatePresetChips.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0151 · DatePresetChips (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface — the native peers of the web `t(key, default)` keys
  in `components/forms/DatePresetChips.tsx` and the preset labels in `web/src/lib/datePresets.ts`. Every
  key/fallback pair below is byte-identical to the web source so the chips read the same on both platforms.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table ("DatePresetChips") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings. In
  test / preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value below, keeping the labels deterministic.
*/

/* --- Group accessible name (web `DatePresetChips.tsx` `t('date.preset.label', 'Quick date range')`) --- */

